[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381392662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111408#issuecomment-3381392662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111408","id":3381392662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ji_UW","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T12:58:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T12:58:12Z","body":"> We've had at least one report of someone crashing here after doing an incremental build\r\n\r\nI had the same issue this morning as well, clean build fixed it (editor build on macOS, for the reference).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381392662/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381478831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111408#issuecomment-3381478831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111408","id":3381478831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JjUWv","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T13:11:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T13:11:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381478831/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3382429675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111408#issuecomment-3382429675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111408","id":3382429675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Jm8fr","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T16:50:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T16:50:29Z","body":"Note that instead of doing a `std::abort`, the application will now run with a random mix of recompiled and non-recompiled files. If e.g. a single class changed memory layout then this will lead to really hard to debug memory corruption crashes. Or it could lead to an algorithm using partially old and partially new code with unpredictable results.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3382429675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3382542307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111408#issuecomment-3382542307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111408","id":3382542307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JnX_j","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:25:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T17:25:55Z","body":"> Note that instead of doing a `std::abort`, the application will now run with a random mix of recompiled and non-recompiled files.\r\n\r\n#111411 will remove the implicit `fast_unsafe` for `dev_build`, so should hopefully resolve that problem for the most part. Anyone who still ends up explicitly passing `fast_unsafe=yes` (to get the shorter incremental build times) should ideally do a clean build I guess, but they will most likely end up running a build or two without `fast_unsafe` first, before they realize the incremental builds are now slower, which should fix the header dependencies.\r\n\r\nHowever, I guess it's theoretically possible for someone to run into trouble if they bisect with `fast_unsafe` and do a clean build on the commits where `CPPEXTPATH` was still a thing, but short of rewriting Git history I'm not sure how you'd fix that. Maybe by adding some arbitrary compile definition to every `thirdparty/*/SCsub` or something, just to force a rebuild of everything that used `CPPEXTPATH`?\r\n\r\nIn any case, they have at least made the explicit choice of entering the \"danger zone\" by enabling `fast_unsafe`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3382542307/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]